    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">internally-grounded realizable entity</skos:altLabel>
    <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">(Elucidation) A disposition b is a realizable entity such that if b ceases to exist then its bearer is physically changed &amp; b's realization occurs when and because this bearer is in some special physical circumstances &amp; this realization occurs in virtue of the bearer's physical make-up</skos:definition>
