    <ns4:ont00001754>http://www.dictionary.com/browse/corporation</ns4:ont00001754>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An Organization formed by an Act of Incorporation that consists of an association of individuals, created by law or under authority of law, having a continuous existence independent of the existences of its members and owners, and having powers and liabilities distinct from those of its members and owners.</skos:definition>
    <ns4:ont00001760 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology</ns4:ont00001760>
