    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Convention on Rights and Duties of States (inter-American); December 26, 1933. https://avalon.law.yale.edu/20th_century/intam03.asp. Accessed 6 Apr. 2023.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
