    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001925"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">x uses y iff x is an instance of an Agent and y is an instance of a Material Entity, such that both x and y participate in some instance of a Process wherein x attempts to accomplish a goal by manipulating, deploying, or leveraging some attribute of y.</skos:definition>
